[PrintTextModified Text:听到提示音后，<br>艾玛看了眼自己的手机。|#0104Adv12_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『魔女审判即将开始』|#0104Adv12_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『请大家务必带好自己的手机，<br>　迅速到审判庭集合』|#0104Adv12_Narrative004|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『如有不遵守者，将由看守强制带走』<br>|#0104Adv12_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『顺带通知一下，紫藤亚里沙小姐的遗体<br>　已经从处刑台上搬下来并妥善处理好了……』|#0104Adv12_Narrative006|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（亚里沙……）|#0104Adv12_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ゆっくりと大扉を開く音
