[PrintTextModified Text:当艾玛走进审判庭时，<br>在场的每一位少女都把目光投向了她。|#0104Adv12_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露，可可，玛格。|#0104Adv12_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（难以相信，参加审判的只剩下我们几个了……）|#0104Adv12_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香看来是不会来了……|#0104Adv12_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:反正搞不好凶手就是她。|#0104Adv12_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香才不会杀人！|#0104Adv12_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:你怎么还在说这种话。<br>不管怎么辩解，肯定是这里的某个人下的手好不好。|#0104Adv12_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:唔……奈叶香没有到场，<br>直接就开始审判真的好吗……|#0104Adv12_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊，真头疼……<br>可是到处找都找不到她，<br>也没有办法了……|#0104Adv12_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就现在四个人开始吧。|#0104Adv12_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:四位少女站上了证人席。|#0104Adv12_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那么，魔女审判现在开庭！|#0104Adv12_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

